<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ 433-5 AT LUNCH ON 2ND DAY OF TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ 433-5 AT LUNCH ON 2ND DAY OF TEST.</headline>
<dateline>DUNEDIN, New Zealand 1996-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 433 for the loss of five wickets at lunch on the second day of the first test against Sri Lanka on Saturday.</p>
<p>Score:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 433 for five (B. Young 187 not out, M. Horne 66, S. Fleming 51, C.Cairns 50 not out).</p>
